[ar:Laufey, Iceland Symphony Orchestra, Hoagy Carmichael, Ned Washington]
[ti:The Nearness of You (Live at The Symphony)]
[00:02.40] It's not the pale moon that excites me
[00:13.14] That thrills and delights me
[00:21.21] Oh no
[00:24.82] It's just the nearness of you
[00:35.29] It isn't your sweet conversation
[00:44.51] That brings this sensation
[00:52.42] Oh no
[00:57.51] It's just the nearness of you
[01:07.24] When you're in my arms
[01:14.65] I can feel you so close to me
[01:23.51] All my wildest dreams
[01:32.62] Come true
[01:39.02] I need no soft lights to enchant me
[01:49.85] If you only grant me the right
[02:03.82] To hold you ever so tight
[02:12.57] And to feel in the night the nearness of you
[02:30.61] 
